{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07646","headline":"行路难 · 孟云卿","name":"行路难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见高山万仞连苍旻，天长地久成埃尘。\n君不见长松百尺多劲节，狂风暴雨终摧折。\n古今何事无圣贤，吾爱伯阳真乃天。\n金堂玉阙朝羣仙，拍手东海成桑田。\n海中之水慎勿枯，乌鸢啄蚌伤明珠。\n行路难，艰险莫踟蹰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟云卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}